WEBVTT

00:02.567 --> 00:07.200
Install Watchkeeper and accept the terms. Everything starts on your own PC.

00:07.967 --> 00:13.900
Download the speech model once. Parakeet listens on your computer, in English, with no internet needed.

00:14.667 --> 00:19.300
Tell it your situation: a headset call, a laptop speaker, or a meeting room.

00:20.067 --> 00:23.233
Pick the meeting type, add the participants, and press Start.

00:24.000 --> 00:25.600
Your first meeting is running.
